  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cloud.colonal.live/index.php/s/MzZ7fHPQZtJL9FX\" alt=\"\"><span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcolonal.live%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cloud.colonal.live/index.php/s/kawp4KjSfsNmnXD/preview\" alt=\"Colonal 社群\" width=\"1920\" height=\"580\"></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>Colonal Mod Pack (CMP) 是由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcolonal.live%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Colonal</a> 彙整的模組合集。本套件專為體驗「法式原版」風格的 Minecraft 困難模式而設計。也就是說，裡面僅包含提升效能與生活品質的模組，不會更動原版的遊戲機制。這樣的配置讓你能夠建造大型的紅石裝置，同時仍能保有足夠的幀數，並提供高品質內容創作的工具。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fColonal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/ac0374b5-d635-4ac3-a0d6-2841bb67469a.png\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>特別收錄：</p>\n<p>包含 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fastchest\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fast Chest</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnvidium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nvidium</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.replaymod.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Replay Mod</a> 與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvanillatweaks.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Tweaks</a></p>",
